-
-Include <linux/ioctl.h> for musl C library compatibility.
-
-This build issue is detected by Buildroot autobuilder:
-http://autobuild.buildroot.net/results/af9/af946fa6fe05ee265e4ac97742b15afeb0cea1ab/
-
